{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t中國共產黨第二十屆中央委員會第五次全體會議、即中共二十屆五中全會，今日至星期四在北京召開。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n會議主要議程是中共中央政治局向中央委員會報告工作，研究持之以恆推進全面從嚴治黨若干重大問題。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:26.487687+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:27:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T00:18:49.596848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:52.333455+00:00","content_hash":"08e0f1aa216eb0a8b9d3441ff8d3ae4000500f2228d77267515d03aaa4c0d81c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}